{"articleNo":"109070","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=109070&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014학년도 2학기 복학생 학과 변경 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.07.11","hit":"4904","attachments":[{"name":"복학생 학과 변경내역.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=109070&attachNo=3934"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">모집단위 폐지 및 신설에 따른 </span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2014학년도 2학기 복학생의 학과 변경 일정</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">을 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">아래와<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span></span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">같이</span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" size=\"3\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">알려드립니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#4c4c4c\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&lt;&lt;복학대상 통보문(우편물)에 학과 변경 내용 포함&gt;&gt;</span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 복학 신청 내역 및 방법 : 첨부물 참조</span></span></span></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><!--StartFragment--><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; 가. 학부(과)가 1:1로 변경되는 경우 : 원스톱으로 복학 신청<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; → 복학 확정 후 교무처에서 일괄 학과 변경</span></font></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp; → 예외 학과 // 물리학전공</font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font size=\"+0\">: 학사서비스센터 방문 복학 신청, 학과 방문 병행(필히 상담 받으세요)</font></span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#747474\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp; 나. 학부(과)/전공을 선택해야 하는 경우 : 학사서비스센터 방문 복학 신청</font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" cla